    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eAny sausage works, so buy whatever is cheapest.\u003c/strong\u003e The original recipe literally says sausages of choice. The curry gravy is doing all the flavor work, so this is not the week to buy premium links.",
